   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Women&#x2019;s Agency in Food and Climate Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to promote food security and sustainable livelihoods for 1.500 women and youth in Buhera and Gwanda districts by:- Increasing access to affordable food, -Improving livelihoods of women and youth, -Building resilience to climate change. TheOverall Impact is to strengthen responsiveness to drought, unemployment, and market gaps. The programme will deliver more resilient, diversified, and youth-inclusive livelihoods while generating stronger evidence and accountability.</narrative>
